					<td>✅ 必须</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>4️⃣</td>
					<td><code>sgl-kernel/csrc/zpu/zpu_extension.cc</code>（新增）</td>
					<td><code>TORCH_LIBRARY_IMPL(sgl_kernel, PrivateUse1, m)</code> 注册</td>
					<td>✅ 必须</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>5️⃣</td>
